<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In Appendix D LoTTE ‣ ColBERTv2: Effective and Efficient Retrieval via Lightweight Late Interaction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Dev Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In Appendix D LoTTE ‣ ColBERTv2: Effective and Efficient Retrieval via Lightweight Late Interaction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Licensing and Anonymity</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
