<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix E Datasets in BEIR ‣ ColBERTv2: Effective and Efficient Retrieval via Lightweight Late Interaction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> lists the BEIR datasets we used in our evaluation, including their respective license information as well as the numbers of documents as well as the number of test set queries. We refer to <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib58" title="" class="ltx_ref">Thakur et al. (2021)</a></cite> for a more detailed description of each of the datasets.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Our Touché evaluation uses an updated version of the data in BEIR, which we use for evaluating the models we run (i.e., ColBERTv2 and RocketQAv2) as well as SPLADEv2.</p>
</div>
